== Notes ==
*The bonus to attack provided by this spell counts towards the +20 [[attack bonus cap]].
* Friendly [[non-player character]]s and characters in the caster's [[party]] receive the beneficial effects. All others are subject to "standard hostile" [[area of effect#Targeting|targeting]] for the negative effects. This may cause neutral characters to go hostile.
*Due to a .2da bug, ''prayer'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of ''bestow curse''.

